# DakuOS hardware support – Testing packages only
#
# Target reference hardware:
#   - Intel Core Ultra 288V (Lunar Lake)
#   - 2-in-1 convertible (tablet mode + rotation)
#   - Wi-Fi 6E / Wi-Fi 7 (2.4 / 5 / 6 GHz)
#   - NVMe SSD

# ---- Intel Core Ultra (Lunar Lake) ----
intel-microcode
thermald
power-profiles-daemon
intel-gpu-tools
mesa-vulkan-drivers
intel-media-va-driver-non-free
i965-va-driver
libva-utils
vulkan-tools

# ---- Sensors / 2-in-1 tablet mode + rotation ----
iio-sensor-proxy
# On-screen keyboard when in tablet mode (Plasma)
plasma-mobile-settings
maliit-keyboard
maliit-framework

# ---- Wi-Fi (firmware + tools) ----
firmware-iwlwifi
iw
wireless-tools
rfkill

# ---- SSD / storage performance ----
fstrim
nvme-cli
smartmontools

# ---- Boot / performance helpers ----
plymouth
plymouth-themes
systemd-timesyncd
